    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this three bedroom mid terraced property in the residential area of Breffni Crescent, located within a short walk of the town centre of Carrick on Shannon. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room, bright kitchen/diner,  stairs leads to three bedrooms & shower room.  The property benefits from a rear yard with shed and off street parking. The property can be accessed via the rear of the property.  The property benefits from some lovely views of the River Shannon to the rear of the property.  This property is within walking distance of all town centre amenities such as schools, shops, restaurants, leisure centre and beautiful walks/parks along the River Shannon and Carrick on Shannon train station which serves the Dublin/Sligo line daily. Ideal starter home. For all viewings on this lovely house please contact Gallagher Auctioneers Ltd."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 3.19m (10'6\") x 1.75m (5'9\")\r\n\r\nLiving Room 3.97m (13'0\") x 3.23m (10'7\")\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner 5.88m (19'3\") x 2.85m (9'4\")\r\n\r\nStairs to First Floor \r\n\r\nLanding 2.73m (8'11\") x 2.56m (8'5\")\r\n\r\nShower Room 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.62m (5'4\")\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.83m (12'7\") x 2.83m (9'3\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 3.27m (10'9\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Three 3.13m (10'3\") x 1.78m (5'10\")"
      },
      {
